OL,3,GNEWSAWebchat tells mum to home-school
OL,4,Aafter fare hike
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother was advised to consider
OL,7,Fhome-schooling her child by a council's
OL,8,Fwebchat after explaining she was
OL,9,Fstruggling to afford a 150% increase in
OL,10,Fbus fares.
OL,12,FCaroline Ashley, a single parent living
OL,13,Fin Castle Acre, west Norfolk, said
OL,14,FNorfolk County Council made the
OL,15,Fsuggestion after she sought support to
OL,16,Fhelp cover the soaring costs.
OL,18,FShe said she was left "flabbergasted"
OL,19,Fafter receiving the council's advice
OL,20,Fand initially thought it was given by
OL,21,FAI. The council has apologised and
OL,22,Finsisted a human was responsible.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
